<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Hezbollah</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1982">1982</a>–</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a> · Also known as Hizbullah</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Hezbollah is a Lebanese Shia Islamist political party and armed group founded in 1982 with Iranian support, in response to the Israeli invasion of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lebanon">Lebanon</a>. It fought Israel in southern Lebanon until the Israeli withdrawal in 2000 and in the wars of 2006 and 2024, and it also intervened in the Syrian civil war. It holds seats in parliament and runs social services, while many states list it as a terrorist organisation.</p></div>
